OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry and mostly cloudy. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry but
OL,8,Fwith a fair amount of cloud.
OL,9,FFreshening southerly wind later in the
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA dry and mostly cloudy
OL,13,Fmorning. Cloudy in the afternoon with
OL,14,Frain, heavy at times, spreading
OL,15,Feastwards. Southerly winds
OL,16,Fstrengthening and becoming strong in
OL,17,Fplaces.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
