OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells and winds
OL,7,Fbecoming light on Friday. Mainly dry
OL,8,Fon Saturday but showers later. Breezy
OL,9,Fwith showers on Sunday.
